(text "MCP6002 PDIP8: channel A 1/2/3 follower; B 7/6/5 idle at GND. R1903 100k series input fault limiting candidate; R1901 22M shunt and C1902 1nF C0G RF shunt after R1903; D1901 external high-side diode A=IN K=5V candidate, R1904 4k7 bleeder candidate to GND; D1902 5V6 Zener rail-to-GND candidate, knee/PVT unqualified; D1903 external lower clamp A=GND K=IN candidate, reverse leakage and severe negative fault unqualified; no rail-sink or power-off protection qualified. SUPPLY LAB 5V ONLY. OUT IS VOLTAGE BENCH, NOT A MOVING COIL DRIVER. NO MAIN AGC/FSD, NO FAB, NO TX." (at 98 191 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "ab200001-2026-4000-8000-000000000069")))
